0..76 Comment "// Univalence at the corollas of a signature: `ua[1, 4](Magma, Magma, f, g)`"
77..151 Comment "// is a path between the two models\' degree telescopes, derived corolla by"
152..227 Comment "// corolla from the translator tables `f` and `g` (Shulman, _Univalence for"
228..304 Comment "// Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity_, doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565;"
305..377 Comment "// a univalence map as a typoid function, Petrakis, _Univalent Typoids_,"
378..453 Comment "// arXiv:2205.06651). Transport along it applies each corolla\'s translator,"
454..519 Comment "// and two tables that agree at every element give the same path."
521..598 Comment "// The magma, the swap, the identity on the booleans and the unit\'s identity."
